sing-box — https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box
Used: version 1.14.4, built into Libbox.xcframework by scripts/build-libbox.sh and linked into
the two tunnel extensions (CryoByteTunnel on iOS, CryoByteTunnelSystem on the Mac).

Source: https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/tree/v1.14.4, built unmodified. The build leaves
some optional parts out through build tags; scripts/build-libbox.sh lists them.
The Go modules sing-box depends on are compiled in with it. Each keeps its own license; they
are listed in sing-box's go.mod.

